WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:08,380
What does blood mean?

2
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:10,780
This blood was from when I beat them

3
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:13,530
You must be stained with blood to some extent, right?

4
00:00:13,730 --> 00:00:14,930
Just this

5
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:18,190
You can judge that I am a great man, right?

6
00:00:18,590 --> 00:00:20,590
I have to be fair about this.

7
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:23,390
You just say someone is a great man for no reason

8
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:26,590
What if this kid slanders you next as a great man?

9
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:28,390
What should you do?

10
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:33,940
I can prove

11
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:36,340
This blood was left behind when he killed Zhang Lei

12
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:38,040
how do you prove

13
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:40,630
Jiang Yuan is my high school classmate

14
00:00:40,630 --> 00:00:41,830
He is a professional forensic scientist

15
00:00:42,230 --> 00:00:44,830
Have the ability to identify whether this blood was left over from last night

16
00:00:46,610 --> 00:00:47,810
If a professional forensic doctor is present

17
00:00:47,810 --> 00:00:49,410
Then it can indeed be identified.

18
00:00:55,770 --> 00:00:56,970
I am indeed a forensic doctor

19
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,700
Can be identified
